{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6:000018:note_appended:bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.3:de4fd584e5dbac756741c1c7a5628adabe7f583ebdf22e19c9e85bb91159653d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:47:22Z","actor":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.3","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.3","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"PROPOSED FOLLOW-UP: day-strip follow-up phases (c6 new-tab, c8 legend overflow) will add new DOM asserts on live FakeNodes — they must use the assert.ok(===) + nodeNote message form, never assert.equal/deepEqual on two live nodes, or the bob-cli-c7 heap OOM returns"}}
{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6:000017:note_appended:bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.1:cf52362dcc4270d36e8658274059f84cead2321e24652655aa763151e0c7f188","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:47:25Z","actor":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.1","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.1","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Baseline: both lib gates in src/native/capture_related/tests.rs (synthetic_vault_query_is_under_250ms, synthetic_vault_draft_contract_is_under_250ms) timed one debug run of the 40x38 synthetic vault and asserted elapsed < 500 ms. That is the flake bob-cli-ca reports under parallel just check.\n\nFix: shared synthetic_perf_vaults() plus assert_paired_perf_gate() following 0e75ca56. Untimed warmup, then 7 paired timed runs against a one-task tiny vault; gate min(big-tiny) < 500 ms and min_big < 2000 ms. Functional same_title / items.len()==1 asserts kept. bob-cli-ca left open for the lander.\n\nTests: (1) Temporary 600 ms sleep in the big timed path (not committed) failed both gates: query min_diff 704 ms, draft min_diff 716 ms. (2) 8/8 isolated cargo test --lib synthetic_vault_ passes while a concurrent cargo test --lib ran (loadavg 20.01 16.83 13.78). (3) just check passed; both tests ok in the 3556-test lib suite.\n\nLimitations: the 500 ms paired floor still matches the old isolated budget; a slowdown smaller than scheduling noise can still hide. Gross 2000 ms bound is for order-of-magnitude regressions only."}}
{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6:000019:note_appended:bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.3:607f12a7c91383b95781aa2ad0ce8af14d40ffb84dccb920b20ff0922d67a4db","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:47:33Z","actor":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.3","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.5.6.5.5.6.6.6.6.3","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Done in bob-plugins (test-only changes, no plugin source edits, no deploy). Added short util.inspect.custom descriptors (tag, classes, child count, 40-char text prefix) to all 11 cyclic FakeNode-style fakes across 9 ledger-tools suites (7x FakeNode, 2x MiniNode, 2x pomodoro Node) plus the new regression files. DEVIATION with evidence: the plan's 'convert identity checks back to assert.equal' step was NOT applied — on Node v22 assert's structural differ ignores inspect.custom and eagerly diffs even with a custom message, so assert.equal/deepEqual on the verbatim 85-node plan-host tree OOMs (exit 134, ~8s at 1024MB) with the descriptor grafted, without it, and with a custom message (probes in /tmp/verbatim*.log). Instead the 11 plan-host identity asserts keep the === form (which never diffs) via a nodeNote() helper whose util.inspect message names both nodes, e.g. failure reads '[FakeNode(DIV.bob-plan...) vs FakeNode(...)]'. New regression scripts/test-ledger-tools-fakenode-inspect.cjs (+child probe, wired into npm test): failing identity assert names both descriptors in ~2ms default heap and ~40ms under a 1024MB child cap, and asserts every suite file carries its descriptor(s). Verified: 11 touched suites 191/191 pass; npm test 3683/3683 pass; npm run validate exit 0. Target task bob-cli-c7 left open for the lander."}}
